ll.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81206]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897798,"PostDate":1433288235,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>These are mine! From David's. They are wedges, in case you can't tell.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81206-shoes\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18009\/sml_gallery_281283_18009_314651.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='shoes'  width='150' height='200'  alt='shoes' id='sml_image_view_81206' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfdb2b2a263acfb0637eed1ed5737db5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I want blue shoes! And I&#039;m having a heck of a time finding what I want that fits!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897801,"PostDate":1433291315,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I want blue shoes! And I'm having a heck of a time finding what I want that fits!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ef7c486e8594517128335e4a2810e6c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1897801\" timestamp=\"1433305715\"]\nI want blue shoes! And I&#039;m having a heck of a time finding what I want that fits![\/quote]so did I originally and that was the reason why I moved on. I couldn&#039;t find any that fit and that were reasonably comfortable :(. Now I love my pink shoes so it&#039;s all good, maybe blue shoes weren&#039;t meant to be for me.","Attachments":[],"Id":1897851,"PostDate":1433341608,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 03 June 2015 - 12:28 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I want blue shoes! And I'm having a heck of a time finding what I want that fits!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>so did I originally and that was the reason why I moved on. I couldn't find any that fit and that were reasonably comfortable <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>. Now I love my pink shoes so it's all good, maybe blue shoes weren't meant to be for me.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"71629150327871448bf7f534f5015e14","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;From our experience on a beach wedding many brides go with flat footwear whether is jewelery sandals that are nice and comfortable to the more casual and trendy barefoot sandals. Or you can also go with the classical satin heels, we love this option for your \"something blue\" being your shoes:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/404198135284315623\/\" alt=\"404198135284315623\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/404198135283130243\/\" alt=\"404198135283130243\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/404198135281619811\/\" alt=\"404198135281619811\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/404198135277659825\/\" alt=\"404198135277659825\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/404198135284582896\/\" alt=\"404198135284582896\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#4a442a;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Adventure Weddings&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#548dd4;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#548dd4;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Toll Free: 1 866.731.8152&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900232,"PostDate":1436623759,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">From our experience on a beach wedding many brides go with flat footwear whether is jewelery sandals that are nice and comfortable to the more casual and trendy barefoot sandals. Or you can also go with the classical satin heels, we love this option for your \"something blue\" being your shoes:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/404198135284315623\/\" alt=\"404198135284315623\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/404198135283130243\/\" alt=\"404198135283130243\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/404198135281619811\/\" alt=\"404198135281619811\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/404198135277659825\/\" alt=\"404198135277659825\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/404198135284582896\/\" alt=\"404198135284582896\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#4a442a\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Adventure Weddings\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong><span  style=\"color:#548dd4\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#548dd4\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Toll Free: 1 866.731.8152<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343044403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.19.134.107","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"49212050a9f119383b22734c56f6900d","RawContent":"Really can&#039;t decide whether to  wear &#039;Barefoot Sandals&#039; \n\n\n\n\n\nor shoes...\n\n\n\n\n\nMight just get both then decide on the day.\n\n\nCan&#039;t seem to find any nice ivory flat sandals anywhere in shops near me. Might have to stop being so picky x\n\n\nMaybeoneday\n\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1900265,"PostDate":1436665445,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Really can't decide whether to  wear 'Barefoot Sandals' <br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1900265]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281816-14366794316.png\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1436679429136.png - Size: 226.46KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281816-14366794316.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1436679429136.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nor shoes...<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1900265]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281816-143667973203.png\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1436679729690.png - Size: 197.2KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-281816-143667973203.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1436679729690.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nMight just get both then decide on the day.<br><br>\nCan't seem to find any nice ivory flat sandals anywhere in shops near me. Might have to stop being so picky x<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78435","Title":"My Wedding Shoes. Show Us Yours...","LastPostDate":1440364757},"Pages":{"TotalItems":49,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
