isten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&amp;amp;productRef=SEARCH&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/shoe\/chinese+laundry+glisten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&amp;amp;productRef=SEARCH&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Still working on accessories for them&amp;nbsp; :wub:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878631,"PostDate":1416272121,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What styles\/colors are your bm's wearing?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My MOH will wear:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7243s-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7243s-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...43s-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p>in pomegrante<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bridesmaids:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7172-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7172-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...172-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7138-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7138-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...138-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7176-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7176-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...176-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p>all in pomegrante<\/p>\n<p>I love that the dresses are all a little different much like my girls themselves.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The girls all really liked the same shoe so I purchased these sandals for them...<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/shoe\/chinese+laundry+glisten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&productRef=SEARCH' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/s...oductRef=SEARCH<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Still working on accessories for them\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361723426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"945c90b325e98d87f286e2c6227a8c06","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much for sharing the website where you found them. I have been searching high and low for dresses online and haven&#039;t had much luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878633,"PostDate":1416282136,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-f