ditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e906def5b72f5b774cebe3108dce1e2f","RawContent":"Jen, they&#039;re gorgeous gorgeous gorgeous!!! Well done. I looked at ones with baguettes too on the side, lovely. \n \n TammyM, I&#039;m back in London now, just got back today... missed you. But, will be visiting Michigan regularly, so next time!\n \n Okay, so I know you all think I&#039;m completely mad, but, this is what I changed my ring for. Just a completely plain solitaire ering, and a completely plain band. I know, I know, my FMIL already told me how crazy I was. But, I LOVE LOVE LOVE It! And I can&#039;t stop staring at it, and i think i&#039;ts so much more beautiful, so I am happy. \n \n and yes, Glenda, you&#039;re right too, the next step, pick a bloody place already!! How am I going to be about the dress... oh dear. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/79745d72a5a1ee57.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/79745d72a6603a0d.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":27302,"PostDate":1171732601,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jen, they're gorgeous gorgeous gorgeous!!! Well done. I looked at ones with baguettes too on the side, lovely. <br \/> <br \/> TammyM, I'm back in London now, just got back today... missed you. But, will be visiting Michigan regularly, so next time!<br \/> <br \/> Okay, so I know you all think I'm completely mad, but, this is what I changed my ring for. Just a completely plain solitaire ering, and a completely plain band. I know, I know, my FMIL already told me how crazy I was. But, I LOVE LOVE LOVE It! And I can't stop staring at it, and i think i'ts so much more beautiful, so I am happy. <br \/> <br \/> and yes, Glenda, you're right too, the next step, pick a bloody place already!! How am I going to be about the dress... oh dear. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=displayimg&imgid=850' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><a href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/79745d72a5a1ee57.jpg\" rel=\"lytebox[posts]\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/79745d72a5a1ee57.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/a><a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=displayimg&imgid=851' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><a href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/79745d72a6603a0d.jpg\" rel=\"lytebox[posts]\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/79745d72a6603a0d.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Margaret & Eric<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mhollendoner@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1167243660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206993.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MagsieMexico","Id":206993,"Name":"MagsieMexico","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb8e62f1c282b68954b90563d228ec8e","RawContent":"Ok, I&#039;ll play! I wanted something very unique for my ring, and he really stepped up to the plate:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbpgimage.php?do=full&amp;amp;p=420&amp;amp;d=1172722361\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n I&#039;m probably going to get a plain platinum band to go with it. Anything more would be too much I think.","Attachments":[],"Id":31019,"PostDate":1172726215,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok, I'll play! I wanted something very unique for my ring, and he really stepped up to the plate:<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbpgimage.php?do=full&p=420&d=1172722361' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbpgimage.php?do=full&p=420&d=1172722361\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I'm probably going to get a plain platinum band to go with it. Anything more would be too much I think.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"debbie.copeland@ymail.com","IpAddress":"66.163.16.56","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171907940,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207190.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Debs","Id":207190,"Name":"Debs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"717166beb7797a5d11bfb5081a5861ca","RawContent":"I think you all have absolutely beautiful rings!! I went and looked at rings and picked this one as my &amp;quot;dream&amp;quot; ring. I still can&#039;t believe I get to wear this everyday!! It is a platinum Tacori ring. The band has .75cts. and the main diamond I believe is 1.02cts. The main diamond is an emerald cut with two smaller emerald cuts on either side.\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/miekodring1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I need opinions on the band though. On the engagement ring, the design only goes halfway around. On the wedding band that is designed to go with it, the design goes all the way around. Would these look funny together or is it just me being paranoid? Any opinion would help because I just don&#039;t know! \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/miekodring2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":31053,"PostDate":1172742010,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think you all have absolutely beautiful rings!! I went and looked at rings and picked this one as my \"dream\" ring. I still can't believe I get to wear this everyday!! It is a platinum Tacori ring. The band has .75cts. and the main diamond I believe is 1.02cts. The main diamond is an emerald cut with two smaller emerald cuts on either side.<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/miekodring1.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/miekodring1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> I need opinions on the band though. On the engagement ring, the design only goes halfway around. On the wedding band that is designed to go with it, the design goes all the way around. Would these look funny together or is it just me being paranoid? Any opinion would help because I just don't know! <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/miekodring2.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/miekodring2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>Mie and RG<\/strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;130\/st\/20070523\/e\/Mie+and+RG%27s+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/5622\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...5622\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"CMDebold@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1172724533,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207226.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MiekoD","Id":207226,"Name":"MiekoD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5698b398fe7b52c6de76e527e962772f","RawContent":"Those cut-outs are hearts, hard to see from this angle. \n My FI said one for past, present, and future. It suits me :o)\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/images.overstock.com\/f\/102\/3117\/8h\/www.overstock.com\/images\/products\/P918037a.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":31054,"PostDate":1172743153,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Those cut-outs are hearts, hard to see from this angle. <br \/> My FI said one for past, present, and future. It suits me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>)<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/images.overstock.com\/f\/102\/3117\/8h\/www.overstock.com\/images\/products\/P918037a.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/images.overstock.com\/f\/102\/3117\/8h\/www.overstock.com\/images\/products\/P918037a.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrsjamyjones@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.201.254.135","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1168256640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207039.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":1000,"PhotoHeight":667,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"starchild","Id":207039,"Name":"starchild","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3835adc94d6b08ea75afe42feef47c5e","RawContent":"We finally went ring shopping today. This is the one we have picked out so far:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/zales.imageg.net\/graphics\/product_images\/pZALE1-2221816t400.jpg\" bord