_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here's my engagement ring, we haven't picked out the wedding band yet, but it will probably be a very thin pave band.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=displayimg&imgid=1514' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><a href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_15434641df3911ff7.jpg\" rel=\"lytebox[posts]\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_15434641df3911ff7.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jill<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i193.photobucket.com\/albums\/z269\/jillklabzuba\/Cabo_2536.jpg\">http:\/\/i193.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...\/Cabo_2536.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jillklabzuba@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1176920616,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207354.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jak27","Id":207354,"Name":"jak27","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e70f6c7d6de27b686f58646ee5d48c07","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_1251462173c4b12d6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt; \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_1251462174d5f000b.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt; \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_12514621750f81820.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Here is my ER and WB again. You can&#039;t really see it in the pics, but there is a small diamond underneath the setting. I think I&#039;m going to go with 2 WBs, one above and one underneath the ER. Metal is palladium.","Attachments":[],"Id":51824,"PostDate":1179076248,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=displayimg&imgid=1272' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><a href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_1251462173c4b12d6.jpg\" rel=\"lytebox[posts]\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_1251462173c4b12d6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/a> <br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=displayimg&imgid=1273' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><a href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_1251462174d5f000b.jpg\" rel=\"lytebox[posts]\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_1251462174d5f000b.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/a> <br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=displayimg&imgid=1274' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><a href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_12514621750f81820.jpg\" rel=\"lytebox[posts]\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_12514621750f81820.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/a><br \/> <br \/> Here is my ER and WB again. You can't really see it in the pics, but there is a small diamond underneath the setting. I think I'm going to go with 2 WBs, one above and one underneath the ER. Metal is palladium.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Susan&Matt 10-12-07, Mia Lily 7-9-08, Charlie David 6-28-10<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"SusanBorzynski@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172809980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207229.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SusanK","Id":207229,"Name":"SusanK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f8fb88875929d9348e154391fdfdbae","RawContent":"Firstly, you all have gorgeous rings!! i just went through all 50 pages of this post and looked at them all!!\n \n \n \n I posted my ring in my newbie post, but i thought it would be more appropriate here.\n \n It&#039;s a pink sapphire. Two-toned white and yellow gold with lots of little diamonds and detailing. My fiancee did a wonderful job designing it!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v491\/Kaposhnic\/set3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v491\/Kaposhnic\/set1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":51946,"PostDate":1179106168,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Firstly, you all have gorgeous rings!! i just went through all 50 pages of this post and looked at them all!!<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I posted my ring in my newbie post, but i thought it would be more appropriate here.<br \/> <br \/> It's a pink sapphire. Two-toned white and yellow gold with lots of little diamonds and detailing. My fiancee did a wonderful job designing it!<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v491\/Kaposhnic\/set3.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v491\/Kaposhnic\/set3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v491\/Kaposhnic\/set1.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v491\/Kaposhnic\/set1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20080719\/e\/we%27re+married%21\/k\/0500\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...0500\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kaposhnic@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1178741791,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207395.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lucky","Id":207395,"Name":"Lucky","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60274b2d74a8b98b4f8d76a7b905b9a6","RawContent":"It just occurred to me that I have never posted a picture of my ring!!! I love it so much, Aaron did an awesome job of picking it out. The three diamonds on the side make it look as if the diamonds run all the way around. I have incredibly small fingers (size 4, sometimes 4.5) so we had to get it resized a trillion times, but I got to keep the original one he bought while my new sizes came in (they couldn&#039;t actually resize it, they had to keep sending it back! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;) So I had a size 6 ring that was WAY too big for me... but I carried it around in my purse and showed it to everyone! lol\n \n Anyways... here it is:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bp3.blogger.com\/_EadiozlzcQ0\/RlTziuZHD5I\/AAAAAAAAAAc\/QEI3y3e70fg\/s320\/413370073008.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":62485,"PostDate":1181615256,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It just occurred to me that I have never posted a picture of my ring!!! I love it so much, Aaron did an awesome job of picking it out. The three diamonds on the side make it look as if the diamonds run all the way around. I have incredibly small fingers (size 4, sometimes 4.5) so we had to get it resized a trillion times, but I got to keep the original one he bought while my new sizes came in (they couldn't actually resize it, they had to keep sending it back! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>) So I had a size 6 ring that was WAY too big for me... but I carried it around in my purse and showed it to everyone! lol<br \/> <br \/> Anyways... here it is:<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bp3.blogger.com\/_EadiozlzcQ0\/RlTziuZHD5I\/AAAAAAAAAAc\/QEI3y3e70fg\/s320\/413370073008.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bp3.blogger.com\/_EadiozlzcQ0\/RlTziuZHD5I\/AAAAAAAAAAc\/QEI3y3e70fg\/s320\/413370073008.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>Happily Married since May 9, 2008<\/strong><br><strong>Proud Mama to Evelyn Eileen since June 8, 2010<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"aaron_courtney@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1171939980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207196.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":266,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CourtneyV","Id":207196,"Name":"CourtneyV","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf19f4c318a075e0a977831e236fc651","RawContent":"Courtney I love your ring! It reminds me of mine, except I have baguettes on the side.\n \n Anyways, I&#039;ve had a few requests of me to post my ring. I&#039;ve already posted it in here but I&#039;ll go ahead and do it again since it&#039;s been a few months and may be hard to find.\n \n It&#039;s from Zales, 1ct. total weight set in white gold. It sparkles so much in person ~ I love it!!!!\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/zales.imageg.net\/graphics\/product_images\/pZALE1-2221816t400.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":64661,"PostDate":1182023711,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Courtney I love your ring! It reminds me of mine, except I have baguettes on the side.<br \/> <br \/> Anyways, I've had a few requests of me to post my ring. I've already posted it in here but I'll go ahead and do it again since it's been a few months and may be hard to find.<br \/> <br \/> It's from Zales, 1ct. total weight set in white gold. It sparkles so much in person ~ I love it!!!!<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/zales.imageg.net\/graphics\/product_images\/pZALE1-2221816t400.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/zales.imageg.net\/graphics\/product_images\/pZALE1-2221816t400.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><strong>~ Jaime & Martin ~<\/strong><br><strong>\"Rain or Swine! 2-0-0-9\"<\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong>We had 24 people attend our wedding in Las Caletas, Mexico on May 24th, 2009!<\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong>We all stayed at The Marriott in P.V., and Honeymooned at The Royal Plantation in Ochos Rios, Jamaica<\/strong><span>!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jlm6873@exchange.uta.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1174152000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207260.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JaimeLynne","Id":207260,"Name":"JaimeLynne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00925570f82e5df1842f4834a18b1767","RawContent":"&lt;div align=\"left\"&gt; Okay, I have LOVED looking at everyone&#039;s GEORGEOUS rings! I have not seen a bad one yet!! It was just like ring shopping! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/jiggy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Jiggy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n My Fiance and I just went to the jeweler to have our bands made &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Woot\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;, so I posted what mine is going to look like. I had no say in my ring, he went and designed it all by himself! He couldn&#039;t have done a better job! I can&#039;t wait to see my band with it!! when we get them I will post his also&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bride.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bride\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i8.photobucket.com\/albums\/a14\/dancerkat\/Ring_3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i8.photobucket.com\/albums\/a14\/dancerkat\/Ring_2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i8.photobucket.com\/albums\/a14\/dancerkat\/Ring_4.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i8.photobucket.com\/albums\/a14\/dancerkat\/Band_2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":64753,"PostDate":1182052443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div align=\"left\"> Okay, I have LOVED looking at everyone's GEORGEOUS rings! I have not seen a bad one yet!! It was just like ring shopping! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/jiggy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Jiggy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> My Fiance and I just went to the jeweler to have our bands made <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Woot\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>, so I posted what mine is going to look like. I had no say in my ring, he went and designed it all by himself! He couldn't have done a better job! I can't wait to see my band with it!! when we get them I will post his also<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bride.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bride\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i8.photobucket.com\/albums\/a14\/dancerkat\/Ring_3.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i8.photobucket.com\/albums\/a14\/dancerkat\/Ring_3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i8.photobucket.com\/albums\/a14\/dancerkat\/Ring_2.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i8.photobucket.com\/albums\/a14\/dancerkat\/Ring_2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i8.photobucket.com\/albums\/a14\/dancerkat\/Ring_4.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i8.photobucket.com\/albums\/a14\/dancerkat\/Ring_4.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i8.photobucket.com\/albums\/a14\/dancerkat\/Band_2.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i8.photobucket.com\/albums\/a14\/dancerkat\/Band_2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Katherine & Seth<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.whenismywedding.com\/signature\/74ba5223f0c73563.gif\">http:\/\/www.whenismywedding.com\/signa...23f0c73563.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"thompson_katherine@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1181664569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207458.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":85,"PhotoHeight":98,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CancunBride07","Id":207458,"Name":"CancunBride07","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4fe882bb0fde6e2ac4a8817edcef417","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;beachbride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Ann,\n firstly congratulations on your wedding! and yes please do post pictures if you get a chance. it is really hard to find a ring to go with it, and if you do have the same ring as me, you know that a band doesn&#039;t sit up against it right because of the setting!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;ok, these aren&#039;t the greatest, but hopefully they give you a good idea! i am trying to remember if Leigh took any of my band\/set at my wedding - but i&#039;m not sure! they&#039;d definitely be better pics though!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_5624676cbd52bc43.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt; \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_5624676cbeb6f330.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":65416,"PostDate":1182190631,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>beachbride<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/93546' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Ann,<br \/> firstly congratulations on your wedding! and yes please do post pictures if you get a chance. it is really hard to find a ring to go with it, and if you do have the same ring as me, you know that a band doesn't sit up against it right because of the setting!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>ok, these aren't the greatest, but hopefully they give you a good idea! i am trying to remember if Leigh took any of my band\/set at my wedding - but i'm not sure! they'd definitely be better pics though!<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=displayimg&imgid=1904' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><a href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_5624676cbd52bc43.jpg\" rel=\"lytebox[posts]\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_5624676cbd52bc43.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/a> <br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=displayimg&imgid=1905' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><a href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_5624676cbeb6f330.jpg\" rel=\"lytebox[posts]\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_5624676cbeb6f330.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161378480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"054682aeceb296c7926ca41dfb9f04ff","RawContent":"Wow! I had no idea how hard it is to get a picture of my ring on my hand! Here is the picture that my FI gave to the jeweler who designed mine&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; \n \n Can someone tell me how to post a picture without making it an attachment?\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/canthardlywaitring.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;4015&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Ring.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:62.5,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":65723,"PostDate":1182221362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow! I had no idea how hard it is to get a picture of my ring on my hand! Here is the picture that my FI gave to the jeweler who designed mine<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <br \/> <br \/> Can someone tell me how to post a picture without making it an attachment?<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/canthardlywaitring.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/canthardlywaitring.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"4015\",\"name\":\"Ring.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":62.5,\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i195.photobucket.com\/albums\/z31\/princezsez\/Wedding2-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i195.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...Wedding2-1.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;125\/st\/20080525\/e\/I+Marry+My+Best+Friend%21%21%21\/k\/5053\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...5053\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"princezsez@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1180448592,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207427.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":84,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Can'tHardlyWait","Id":207427,"Name":"Can'tHardlyWait","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c93425231924ec5b7cb37d22411baab","RawContent":"Here is mine. I am having issues find a wedding band that will work due to the unique design of it. I may buy a simple band at first than get it professionally done later.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i163.photobucket.com\/albums\/t302\/yellowred24\/10029987MED.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i163.photobucket.com\/albums\/t302\/yellowred24\/10029987s.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":66071,"PostDate":1182285136,"Pos