or a long time between the Chapel mermaid gown and flowers wedding dress&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"224239\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224239\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"224240\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224240\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"224241\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224241\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;I love both dresses....who are the designers?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1808812,"PostDate":1382433679,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>Miriam005<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>how do you think of the two dulex wedding dress,in fact,I havn't paid for it ,I vacillated for a long time between the Chapel mermaid gown and flowers wedding dress<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"224239\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224239\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"224240\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224240\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"224241\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224241\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>I love both dresses....who are the designers?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357660461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40f352badf81d29c73eae03b82958c6e","RawContent":"Flowers! I love the lace. It&#039;s very feminine.","Attachments":[],"Id":1808867,"PostDate":1382454577,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Flowers! I love the lace. It's very feminine.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karahandy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317688263,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246188.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":149,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KaraMae","Id":246188,"Name":"KaraMae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"458d73675b9b50c8c3f9d7be8a689ea7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224386\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224386\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224387\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is my second dress\/party dress. &amp;nbsp;Got a good deal on it at a Loehmann&#039;s bridal event. &amp;nbsp;I didn&#039;t buy my actual dress yet but I just thought this was so fun and perfect for Mexico I didn&#039;t want to pass it up. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s a surprise for my fiance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\":cheer2:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809024,"PostDate":1382490845,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224386\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224386\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224387\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>This is my second dress\/party dress. \u00a0Got a good deal on it at a Loehmann's bridal event. \u00a0I didn't buy my actual dress yet but I just thought this was so fun and perfect for Mexico I didn't want to pass it up. \u00a0It's a surprise for my fiance.\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\":cheer2:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\