Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8dffb67e07f49ca2d5c1c18651e6138","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;martap7&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Went in for my first&amp;nbsp;dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; Very elegant. You look beautiful in that dress.","Attachments":[],"Id":1809355,"PostDate":1382616892,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>martap7<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br\/><br\/><p>Went in for my first\u00a0dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p><\/div><\/div><p>\u00a0<\/p> Very elegant. You look beautiful in that dress.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>Tuff Luv<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Reese & Kandie<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Hard Rock<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>April 12, 2014<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lonitaharlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374010532,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271619.jpeg?_r=1398882048","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TuffLuv","Id":271619,"Name":"TuffLuv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"405f4b2ef2702e9ff68ff0564a398137","RawContent":"Gorgeous!","Attachments":[],"Id":1809367,"PostDate":1382619423,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Gorgeous!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dfrey607@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"100.1.103.157","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1370080327,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270172.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wedding2014","Id":270172,"Name":"Wedding2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e465012489d272c86d00ad19ce96abe5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"martap7\"]\nWent in for my first dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done :) [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 350px; height: 467px\"&gt; [\/url] [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 350px; height: 467px\"&gt; [\/url][\/quote] Pretty dress! Was this in Tigard? I got my dress from the Tigard Bridal Exclusives. They did a really good job altering the neckline on mine. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1809370,"PostDate":1382621138,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"martap7\" url=\"\/t\/85\/show&#045;us&#045;your&#045;wedding&#045;dress\/7650#post_1957296\"><p>Went in for my first\u00a0dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 467px\"><\/span> <\/a> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 467px\"><\/span> <\/a><\/p><\/blockquote> Pretty dress! Was this in Tigard? I got my dress from the Tigard Bridal Exclusives. They did a really good job altering the neckline on mine. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karahandy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317688263,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246188.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":149,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KaraMae","Id":246188,"Name":"KaraMae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd0e7eb605689aef2517c41c55084a85","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KaraMae\"]\nPretty dress! Was this in Tigard? I got my dress from the Tigard Bridal Exclusives. They did a really good job altering the neckline on mine. :)[\/quote]Yes it is from tigard :) did u get this same one? If so what undergarments did u use? I&#039;m having trouble with something giving me good book support :\/","Attachments":[],"Id":1809377,"PostDate":1382623369,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"KaraMae\" url=\"\/t\/85\/show&#045;us&#045;your&#045;wedding&#045;dress\/7650#post_1957440\"><p>Pretty dress! Was this in Tigard? I got my dress from the Tigard Bridal Exclusives. They did a really good job altering the neckline on mine. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/blockquote>Yes it is from tigard <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> did u get this same one? If so what undergarments did u use? I'm having trouble with something giving me good book support :\/\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pacynamarta@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.22.189.192","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359326538,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265239.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"martap7","Id":265239,"Name":"martap7","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"11c43b84798277968fc0365b87103b41","RawContent":"[quote name=\"m8chow\"]\nNJBride - Love the party dress!  You&#039;re going to have so much fun in this! Wow!!!  It&#039;s beautiful!!  Who is the maker of your dress?[\/quote]This is Allure 8856","Attachments":[],"Id":1809378,"PostDate":1382623502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"m8chow\" url=\"\/t\/85\/show&#045;us&#045;your&#045;wedding&#045;dress\/7650#post_1957361\"><p>NJBride - Love the party dress!\u00a0 You're going to have so much fun in this! Wow!!!\u00a0 It's beautiful!!\u00a0 Who is the maker of your dress?<\/p><\/blockquote>This is Allure 8856\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pacynamarta@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.22.189.192","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359326538,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265239.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"martap7","Id":265239,"Name":"martap7","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42cc19d6143e76717b39175a481c7aa2","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7650#post_1957094\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;NJBride2014&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224386\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224386\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224387\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is my second dress\/party dress. &amp;nbsp;Got a good deal on it at a Loehmann&#039;s bridal event. &amp;nbsp;I didn&#039;t buy my actual dress yet but I just thought this was so fun and perfect for Mexico I didn&#039;t want to pass it up. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s a surprise for my fiance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\":cheer2:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;I love it- so practical and cute. I wanted a second dress but I ended up loving my dress so much I didn&#039;t want to take it off. I couldn&#039;t find anything comparably pretty for the right price- but you seem to have found it! It&#039;s so flirty and cute.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809537,"PostDate":1382700895,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7650#post_1957094\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>NJBride2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224386\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224386\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224387\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>This is my second dress\/party dress. \u00a0Got a good deal on it at a Loehmann's bridal event. \u00a0I didn't buy my actual dress yet but I just thought this was so fun and perfect for Mexico I didn't want to pass it up. \u00a0It's a surprise for my fiance.\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\":cheer2:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>I love it- so practical and cute. I wanted a second dress but I ended up loving my dress so much I didn't want to take it off. I couldn't find anything comparably pretty for the right price- but you seem to have found it! It's so flirty and cute.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Happily married to the love of my life- since July 5, 2013<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"evelynlvazquez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"165.155.200.66","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343669362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258580.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EVKnowsitall","Id":258580,"Name":"EVKnowsitall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac873b1e90cd23f81e33b639a7ad5fd1","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7650#post_1957296\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;martap7&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;Went in for my first&amp;nbsp;dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;What a sexy dress! I absolutely love the train and the beadwork, so stunning! I had a strange dress and the cut was similar to yours, it was low in the back, had thin see through beaded straps and was slightly low in the front- it seemed there was no such bra for me. I ended up having the bridal salon sew in cups, but my mother insisted I needed a lift. I bought the strapless, backless, silicon stick on cutlets. I also bought a medical adhesive to keep the bra on but the adhesive was so sticky IU didn&#039;t need it. The day of my wedding, we couldn&#039;t zip my dress and I started to cry. I thought it wouldn&#039;t fit- we discovered it was because the cups sewn in conflicted with the silicon bra. I ended up going braless so my little flat boobs had to suffice. Honestly- It didn&#039;t matter. It was really comfortable, and I am who I am.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;You can get the silicone bra- it seems to be the best for your dress silhouette.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809540,"PostDate":1382701165,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7650#post_1957296\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>martap7<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>Went in for my first\u00a0dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>What a sexy dress! I absolutely love the train and the beadwork, so stunning! I had a strange dress and the cut was similar to yours, it was low in the back, had thin see through beaded straps and was slightly low in the front- it seemed there was no such bra for me. I ended up having the bridal salon sew in cups, but my mother insisted I needed a lift. I bought the strapless, backless, silicon stick on cutlets. I also bought a medical adhesive to keep the bra on but the adhesive was so sticky IU didn't need it. The day of my wedding, we couldn't zip my dress and I started to cry. I thought it wouldn't fit- we discovered it was because the cups sewn in conflicted with the silicon bra. I ended up going braless so my little flat boobs had to suffice. Honestly- It didn't matter. It was really comfortable, and I am who I am.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>You can get the silicone bra- it seems to be the best for your dress silhouette.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Happily married to the love of my life- since July 5, 2013<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"evelynlvazquez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"165.155.200.66","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343669362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258580.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EVKnowsitall","Id":258580,"Name":"EVKnowsitall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f255f6d0fb77fa76ccfe0f90b202437","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7650#post_1957094\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;NJBride2014&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224386\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224386\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224387\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is my second dress\/party dress. &amp;nbsp;Got a good deal on it at a Loehmann&#039;s bridal event. &amp;nbsp;I didn&#039;t buy my actual dress yet but I just thought this was so fun and perfect for Mexico I didn&#039;t want to pass it up. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s a surprise for my fiance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\":cheer2:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Too cute!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809733,"PostDate":1382805796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7650#post_1957094\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>NJBride2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224386\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224386\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224387\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>This is my second dress\/party dress. \u00a0Got a good deal on it at a Loehmann's bridal event. \u00a0I didn't buy my actual dress yet but I just thought this was so fun and perfect for Mexico I didn't want to pass it up. \u00a0It's a surprise for my fiance.\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\":cheer2:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>Too cute!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellek.rmt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.144.64.166","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1360200280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265769.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MOrdonez","Id":265769,"Name":"MOrdonez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d2156450b14741cea7357d8e4885115","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7610#post_1951642\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ClassicGirl&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n As of right now (and probably will be because I am in love with it and have tried on many and nothing comes close...) is Maggie sottero&#039;s karena royale in gold. &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"222131\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/222131\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Gorgeous!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809734,"PostDate":1382805879,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7610#post_1951642\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>ClassicGirl<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> As of right now (and probably will be because I am in love with it and have tried on many and nothing comes close...) is Maggie sottero's karena royale in gold. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"222131\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/222131\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/div> <p>Gorgeous!!!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellek.rmt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.144.64.166","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1360200280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265769.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MOrdonez","Id":265769,"Name":"MOrdonez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d54718ab30350dd5dce740c74b7621cd","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7660#post_1957447\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;martap7&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n \n Yes it is from tigard :) did u get this same one? If so what undergarments did u use? I&#039;m having trouble with something giving me good book support :\/&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;\n Oh no, I didn&#039;t get the same dress. Sorry that was confusing! Try using those \"sticky chicken cutlets\". I&#039;ve used those before in other dresses and they worked well. Not sure what your cup size is but if it&#039;s not too large, they may work. I&#039;d ask your seamstress for suggestions.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809830,"PostDate":1382881149,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7660#post_1957447\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>martap7<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Yes it is from tigard <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> did u get this same one? If so what undergarments did u use? I'm having trouble with something giving me good book support :\/<\/div> <\/div> <p><br \/> Oh no, I didn't get the same dress. Sorry that was confusing! Try using those \"sticky chicken cutlets\". I've used those before in other dresses and they worked well. Not sure what your cup size is but if it's not too large, they may work. I'd ask your seamstress for suggestions.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karahandy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317688263,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246188.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":149,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KaraMae","Id":246188,"Name":"KaraMae","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":7840,"NextPage":7850,"PreviousPage":7830,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
