{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbb1289c7453ac02dc5ccd539d85b9ee","RawContent":"[quote name=\"IrieBride08\"]\n*Sigh* Ok, here&#039;s my wedding dress. I was originally looking for the slim, sleek, beachy, sexy look, but those looked super crappy on me. (I was so disappointed!) I tried this dress on and it made me feel so petite (when I totally am NOT!) LOL!! I&#039;m still getting used to this different silhouette, which could change the tone of my whole wedding! It is a Monique Luo \"three tier\" organza dress. It was suprising light and airy! All I have is this crappy cell phone shot, but I just found a pic online to show some of the detail. The best part is I got it for $349, so if I find something better, I have options! Whatcha think? [img]http:\/\/&lt;img%20alt=[\/img] [img]http:\/\/&lt;img%20alt=[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1810177,"PostDate":1383000608,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"IrieBride08\" url=\"\/t\/85\/show&#045;us&#045;your&#045;wedding&#045;dress\/90#post_162102\"><p>*Sigh* Ok, here's my wedding dress. I was originally looking for the slim, sleek, beachy, sexy look, but those looked super crappy on me. (I was so disappointed!) I tried this dress on and it made me feel so petite (when I totally am NOT!) LOL!! I'm still getting used to this different silhouette, which could change the tone of my whole wedding! It is a Monique Luo \"three tier\" organza dress. It was suprising light and airy! All I have is this crappy cell phone shot, but I just found a pic online to show some of the detail. The best part is I got it for $349, so if I find something better, I have options! Whatcha think? <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i241.photobucket.com\/albums\/ff230\/Gigi36_2007\/GiWeddingDress.jpg\" style=\"border:0px solid;\"><\/span> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i241.photobucket.com\/albums\/ff230\/Gigi36_2007\/moniqueluocouture.jpg\" style=\"border:0px solid;\"><\/span><\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lashaundra95@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.204.222.48","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1381958116,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274312.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MickeyMouse","Id":274312,"Name":"MickeyMouse","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1d9a6bc95cad15f285049b87eeb7698","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MickeyMouse\"][\/quote] Where did you purchase your dress?","Attachments":[],"Id":1810178,"PostDate":1383000675,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"MickeyMouse\" url=\"\/t\/85\/show&#045;us&#045;your&#045;wedding&#045;dress\/7650#post_1958247\"><p><\/p><\/blockquote> Where did you purchase your dress?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lashaundra95@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.204.222.48","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1381958116,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274312.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MickeyMouse","Id":274312,"Name":"MickeyMouse","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c634d8424de89b9d7d83b564d16e31e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"IrieBride08\"]\n*Sigh* Ok, here&#039;s my wedding dress. I was originally looking for the slim, sleek, beachy, sexy look, but those looked super crappy on me. (I was so disappointed!) I tried this dress on and it made me feel so petite (when I totally am NOT!) LOL!! I&#039;m still getting used to this different silhouette, which could change the tone of my whole wedding! It is a Monique Luo \"three tier\" organza dress. It was suprising light and airy! All I have is this crappy cell phone shot, but I just found a pic online to show some of the detail. The best part is I got it for $349, so if I find something better, I have options! Whatcha think? [img]http:\/\/&lt;img%20alt=[\/img] [img]http:\/\/&lt;img%20alt=[\/img][\/quote] Where did you purchase your dress?","Attachments":[],"Id":1810179,"PostDate":1383000877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"IrieBride08\" url=\"\/t\/85\/show&#045;us&#045;your&#045;wedding&#045;dress\/90#post_162102\"><p>*Sigh* Ok, here's my wedding dress. I was originally looking for the slim, sleek, beachy, sexy look, but those looked super crappy on me. (I was so disappointed!) I tried this dress on and it made me feel so petite (when I totally am NOT!) LOL!! I'm still getting used to this different silhouette, which could change the tone of my whole wedding! It is a Monique Luo \"three tier\" organza dress. It was suprising light and airy! All I have is this crappy cell phone shot, but I just found a pic online to show some of the detail. The best part is I got it for $349, so if I find something better, I have options! Whatcha think? <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i241.photobucket.com\/albums\/ff230\/Gigi36_2007\/GiWeddingDress.jpg\" style=\"border:0px solid;\"><\/span> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i241.photobucket.com\/albums\/ff230\/Gigi36_2007\/moniqueluocouture.jpg\" style=\"border:0px solid;\"><\/span><\/p><\/blockquote> Where did you purchase your dress?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lashaundra95@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.204.222.48","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1381958116,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274312.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MickeyMouse","Id":274312,"Name":"MickeyMouse","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c505d21b9b0171071f242c4769328750","RawContent":"This os[quote name=\"Chantel\" url=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7500#post_1940309\"]Hi Jenn, BEAUTIFUL DRESS! This dress has such a beautiful shape and simplicity to it and for that reason, I would say go without the bling. However, the bling is very nicely done, nicely placed so that it balances the dress and fits in the dress&#039; design very naturally so going with the bling is a good option too! Love the flare at the bottom of the dress - my dress does that too though so I might be biased! ;) Good pick :) This is my dress as well! I am doing a blingy belt with mine. Have you tried that?","Attachments":[],"Id":1810197,"PostDate":1383005350,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This os[quote name=\"Chantel\" url=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7500#post_1940309\"]Hi Jenn, BEAUTIFUL DRESS! This dress has such a beautiful shape and simplicity to it and for that reason, I would say go without the bling. However, the bling is very nicely done, nicely placed so that it balances the dress and fits in the dress' design very naturally so going with the bling is a good option too! Love the flare at the bottom of the dress - my dress does that too though so I might be biased! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> Good pick <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> This is my dress as well! I am doing a blingy belt with mine. Have you tried that?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chelseapjohnson@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"70.72.57.238","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361480068,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266402.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chelseapaige37","Id":266402,"Name":"chelseapaige37","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5fc54d6ff3955abca397de4da1a0e33","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7620#post_1955591\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;jointurks&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s mine! Haven&#039;t decided on sash or no-sash yet :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"LEAD Technologies Inc. V1.01&#10;\" data-id=\"223783\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223783\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"223784\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223784\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"223785\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223785\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Gorgeous!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810304,"PostDate":1383042958,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7620#post_1955591\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>jointurks<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>Here's mine! Haven't decided on sash or no-sash yet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"LEAD Technologies Inc. V1.01&#10;\" data-id=\"223783\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223783\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"223784\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223784\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"223785\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223785\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>Gorgeous!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cmtims13@gmail.com","IpAddress":"209.249.116.2","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1381248110,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274096.jpg?_r=1389040352","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CourtneyTX","Id":274096,"Name":"CourtneyTX","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bad35f1d04d21141ec612a3d4dd90c0a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MickeyMouse\"]\nWhere did you purchase your dress?[\/quote] I just love the dress! It fits you perfectly!! You are going to be one gorgeous bride!","Attachments":[],"Id":1810377,"PostDate":1383057113,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"MickeyMouse\" url=\"\/t\/85\/show&#045;us&#045;your&#045;wedding&#045;dress\/7670#post_1958249\"><p>Where did you purchase your dress?<\/p><\/blockquote> I just love the dress! It fits you perfectly!! You are going to be one gorgeous bride!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nanasb1214@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363109590,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267265.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":189,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nanasb1214","Id":267265,"Name":"nanasb1214","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"094190fb35e90522c66e95d56b20ab2e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"225268\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225268\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"225267\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225267\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"225269\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225269\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is my dress&amp;nbsp;and belt&amp;nbsp;I love it so much totally not what I had pictured myself in but when I tried it on everything just worked so perfectly.&amp;nbsp; This was mine and all my bridesmaids\/mother favorite dress.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m glad to have this part or the wedding planning finally done with.&amp;nbsp; Now just have to wait for it to come in uh 8 months is a long time.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"225270\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225270\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"225271\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225271\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"225272\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225272\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Here are some pictures with me in it.&amp;nbsp;Note the the best pics because the sample dress was a couple sizes to small but you get the effect.&amp;nbsp; Also this is not the veil since they didn&#039;t have the right veil that matched my lace but very close.&amp;nbsp; I really wanted a lace dress with some kind of strap as I&#039;m busty up top and also wanted a mermaid cut with a fun bottom and this dress was perfect for me.&amp;nbsp; What do you guys think?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810413,"PostDate":1383065024,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"225268\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225268\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"225267\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225267\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"225269\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225269\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>This is my dress\u00a0and belt\u00a0I love it so much totally not what I had pictured myself in but when I tried it on everything just worked so perfectly.\u00a0 This was mine and all my bridesmaids\/mother favorite dress.\u00a0 I'm glad to have this part or the wedding planning finally done with.\u00a0 Now just have to wait for it to come in uh 8 months is a long time.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"225270\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225270\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"225271\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225271\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"225272\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225272\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>Here are some pictures with me in it.\u00a0Note the the best pics because the sample dress was a couple sizes to small but you get the effect.\u00a0 Also this is not the veil since they didn't have the right veil that matched my lace but very close.\u00a0 I really wanted a lace dress with some kind of strap as I'm busty up top and also wanted a mermaid cut with a fun bottom and this dress was perfect for me.\u00a0 What do you guys think?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357660461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5e805b3207a1f077b10ed36e01b24f3","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7630#post_1955700\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt; &lt;p&gt;This dress is stunning, Leanne! Wow!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Quote:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;leannesmith&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223826\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223826\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;\n \n My dress!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810417,"PostDate":1383065886,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7630#post_1955700\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"> <p>This dress is stunning, Leanne! Wow!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Quote:<\/p> <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>leannesmith<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223826\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223826\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> My dress!<\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0 <p>\u00a0<\/p> <\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chantel.c.short@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.47.253.12","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357902437,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264260.jpg?_r=1398219642","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Chantel","Id":264260,"Name":"Chantel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74c388c07508a921489b0dd024df6b31","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7630#post_1955837\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt; &lt;p&gt;What a good find! You&#039;ll be a beautiful bride!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Quote:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;SkyHighT100&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n So I completely lucked into my dress. A coworker of my Aunt was about to give her dress to Goodwill. Knowing I was engaged my aunt sent it to me. It was amazing and so much more than I could have afforded at a bridal shop. We are getting married at Ponce Inlet Beach next month so I knew the train just wasn&#039;t going to work. I took the dress to a local seamstress and they worked some serious magic!!! Not wanting to let the beautiful beading of the train go to waste they made a new modesty panel for behind the corset and a shawl incase it gets chilly. I am SO excited to wear it in just 26 days!! I&#039;ll be sure to post better photos after the wedding, these were from my moms cellphone.\n \n Model photo:\n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223865\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223865\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;\n \n Original back:\n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223866\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223866\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;\n \n After alterations:\n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223867\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223867\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223868\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223868\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810418,"PostDate":1383065918,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7630#post_1955837\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"> <p>What a good find! You'll be a beautiful bride!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Quote:<\/p> <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>SkyHighT100<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> So I completely lucked into my dress. A coworker of my Aunt was about to give her dress to Goodwill. Knowing I was engaged my aunt sent it to me. It was amazing and so much more than I could have afforded at a bridal shop. We are getting married at Ponce Inlet Beach next month so I knew the train just wasn't going to work. I took the dress to a local seamstress and they worked some serious magic!!! Not wanting to let the beautiful beading of the train go to waste they made a new modesty panel for behind the corset and a shawl incase it gets chilly. I am SO excited to wear it in just 26 days!! I'll be sure to post better photos after the wedding, these were from my moms cellphone.<br \/> <br \/> Model photo:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223865\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223865\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Original back:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223866\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223866\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> After alterations:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223867\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223867\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223868\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223868\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chantel.c.short@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.47.253.12","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357902437,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264260.jpg?_r=1398219642","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Chantel","Id":264260,"Name":"Chantel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bec2219a0ea58e06957be89c773e8f77","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7640#post_1956851\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt; &lt;p&gt;Although I do love the mermaid shape, I think the flowers dress is gorgeous! Such pretty details on that dress!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Quote:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Miriam005&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;how do you think of the two dulex wedding dress,in fact,I havn&#039;t paid for it ,I vacillated for a long time between the Chapel mermaid gown and flowers wedding dress&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"224239\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224239\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"224240\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224240\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"224241\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224241\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810419,"PostDate":1383066063,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7640#post_1956851\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"> <p>Although I do love the mermaid shape, I think the flowers dress is gorgeous! Such pretty details on that dress!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Quote:<\/p> <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>Miriam005<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>how do you think of the two dulex wedding dress,in fact,I havn't paid for it ,I vacillated for a long time between the Chapel mermaid gown and flowers wedding dress<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"224239\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224239\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"224240\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224240\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"224241\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224241\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chantel.c.short@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.47.253.12","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357902437,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264260.jpg?_r=1398219642","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Chantel","Id":264260,"Name":"Chantel","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":7850,"NextPage":7860,"PreviousPage":7840,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
