n November 8th of 2014. I know I still have alot of time but I do not want anything to catch me by surprise.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Can I ask what your centerpieces looked like?? I also want to do OOTC bags! :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Hopefully you still have this account and are able to answer back to me.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1806531,"PostDate":1381420491,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi There,<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>How were you able to meet with all these people before the wedding cruise. I am getting married with royal on November 8th of 2014. I know I still have alot of time but I do not want anything to catch me by surprise.<\/p> <p>Can I ask what your centerpieces looked like?? I also want to do OOTC bags! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Hopefully you still have this account and are able to answer back to me.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Thank you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jessica.romo4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381420359,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274137.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jegr1108","Id":274137,"Name":"jegr1108","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.251.91.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72852,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e19135a86a5f5e2550abfd50cb6c6a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;eek.&amp;nbsp; sorry to hear about your experience...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1821978,"PostDate":1388767350,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>eek.\u00a0 sorry to hear about your experience...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ylan9383@gmail.com","IpAddress":"209.251.91.140","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387216140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275646.jpg?_r=1388768729","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ylan9383","Id":275646,"Name":"ylan9383","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.0.106.148","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72852,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1fc8572e6eadf8d8e413ed82f37c8e0c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;sorry to hear about your experience! i had originally wanted to do a RC wedding&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1822173,"PostDate":1388788164,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>sorry to hear about your experience! i had originally wanted to do a RC wedding<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"starienight915@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.0.106.148","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388775386,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275861.jpg?_r=1395122863","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Priti","Id":275861,"Name":"Priti","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.234.104.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72852,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1e293da58855d6b5fe837e0bb7b29a2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Priti\"] -&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;After reading all the bad reviews, I went with the best of both worlds. Go on an RC cruise for the wedding, but have an outside wedding planner handle the ceremony at one of the ports.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s a little more complicated, but worth it to not have to deal with RCCL&#039;s wedding dept.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1822435,"PostDate":1388859937,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275861\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275861-priti\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Priti<\/span><\/a> -<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>After reading all the bad reviews, I went with the best of both worlds. Go on an RC cruise for the wedding, but have an outside wedding planner handle the ceremony at one of the ports.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's a little more complicated, but worth it to not have to deal with RCCL's wedding dept.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"atlaeludlow@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.234.104.236","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1367267186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269116.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gresley","Id":269116,"Name":"gresley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.232.1.242","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72852,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"edd49c1c48748285184cac8b031fc31b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have heard nothing but bad.&amp;nbsp; Glad we are going with Carnival.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857201,"PostDate":1403896965,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have heard nothing but bad.\u00a0 Glad we are going with Carnival.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barbarabusybee@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.232.1.242","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403835829,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278719.jpg?_r=1404077494","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BarbaraBusybee","Id":278719,"Name":"BarbaraBusybee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.23.131.118","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72852,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"009839a3c2c2b11ba4f1546b75550ac2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;thank you !!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859508,"PostDate":1405367340,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>thank you !!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"zupochka@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.23.131.118","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1405363606,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/p