e","Id":267452,"Name":"sofialouise","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68642,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4912e81a1ac026228104fb6e00e7aa2","RawContent":"I am too! September 21,2013 in Half Moon Cay. I&#039;ve found several Bahamas wedding via cruise ship on cruise critic but not many in HMC.","Attachments":[],"Id":1751367,"PostDate":1367070458,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am too! September 21,2013 in Half Moon Cay. I've found several Bahamas wedding via cruise ship on cruise critic but not many in HMC.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redkenmecrazy@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1367064189,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269027.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RedkenMeCrazy","Id":269027,"Name":"RedkenMeCrazy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68642,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"514e6c72a8f785b87e8400111a310612","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m still in the deciding phase -- how\/why did you guys decide on carnival?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1752396,"PostDate":1367299673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm still in the deciding phase -- how\/why did you guys decide on carnival?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"atlaeludlow@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.234.104.236","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1367267186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269116.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gresley","Id":269116,"Name":"gresley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68642,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a0dd59afa295885f8b935f1e41c36a30","RawContent":"Im choosing carnival mostly because of my personality and that of my guests. Although the grandparents are coming the majority of my guests are 18-30 (graphic designers, bartenders, models, photographers etc) and we love to party. Shots contests, truth and dare even pranks are the norm with my crowd. I love carnival. It&#039;s a FUN ship literally and figuratively. Yes it may be loud, ghetto, sometimes cheesy but you know what it&#039;s not THAT bad. It&#039;s what you make it. Now if I&#039;m with my fi and we want a less spring break style cruise you&#039;ll find us on NCL. Lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1753307,"PostDate":1367452759,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Im choosing carnival mostly because of my personality and that of my guests. Although the grandparents are coming the majority of my guests are 18-30 (graphic designers, bartenders, models, photographers etc) and we love to party. Shots contests, truth and dare even pranks are the norm with my crowd. I love carnival. It's a FUN ship literally and figuratively. Yes it may be loud, ghetto, sometimes cheesy but you know what it's not THAT bad. It's what you make it. Now if I'm with my fi and we want a less spring break style cruise you'll find us on NCL. Lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"burberrybabe_21@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364761137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268012.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PrincessJanay","Id":268012,"Name":"PrincessJanay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68642,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe9c6c2b74536630729db287e97bb1f5","RawContent":"Hi girls !!!! I&#039;m pretty new to this thread. We are sailing on carnival ecstasy on march 7,2014 to Nassau. We are having our wedding through the wedding planner Anna Fox at the Poop Deck. I decided on the wedding planner because I felt as the cruise ship didn&#039;t really offer that much for the amount they were asking. Last year, My fianc\u00a9 and I went on a week long carnival to western carribean. we had a blast!!!!!! We are excited for this weekend cruise for our wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":1803287,"PostDate":1380320673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi girls !!!! I'm pretty new to this thread. We are sailing on carnival ecstasy on march 7,2014 to Nassau. We are having our wedding through the wedding planner Anna Fox at the Poop Deck. I decided on the wedding planner because I felt as the cruise ship didn't really offer that much for the amount they were asking. Last year, My fianc\u00a9 and I went on a week long carnival to western carribean. we had a blast!!!!!! We are excited for this weekend cruise for our wedding.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisagonzal1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.253.103.98","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1368534902,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269561.jpg?_r=1389651959","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sweetprincess80","Id":269561,"Name":"sweetprincess80","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"68642","Title":"Carnival Ecstasy Brides (Past and Future","LastPostDate":1380320673},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
