st posted in the PV area forum, but I am in the early stages of planning a destination wedding in PV area in October 2016.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Looking for an AI venue that accommodates a private reception\/dancing for less than 40 people, that is also wheelchair accessible. More info in my other post in the PV forum ; )&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks for all the future help I am sure I will get in this community!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheers,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Kimberly&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903462,"PostDate":1440602164,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just posted in the PV area forum, but I am in the early stages of planning a destination wedding in PV area in October 2016.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Looking for an AI venue that accommodates a private reception\/dancing for less than 40 people, that is also wheelchair accessible. More info in my other post in the PV forum ; )<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for all the future help I am sure I will get in this community!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cheers,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Kimberly<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimc0486@msn.com","IpAddress":"66.235.46.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440601276,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kimberlyc","Id":284575,"Name":"kimberlyc","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79535","Title":"Newbie Planning Pv Area Dw!","LastPostDate":1440602164},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
