I am free August 14th and always down for a good drink (or 5) especially on a Friday night <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>. So is O&B our spot for that date? I work in Liberty Village and I'm very new to commuting, but I'm sure I'll figure it out.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So O&B at 7pm on August 14th?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So excited to meet you ladies :-)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laurena1229@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.68.117.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430933265,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Laurena1229","Id":283004,"Name":"Laurena1229","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"020fd0f809675d934fc99c49d1e537c2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh my goodness - is that a date? With all the brides to be\/new brides here that would be mission accomplished if we have an agreement!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How about a last roll call?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901913,"PostDate":1438777976,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\